 },
 "summary": "A family of rotary potentiometers on a 9.8 mm wide body with an insulated 6 mm shaft and snap-in legs for through-hole boards. RK09K turns 280° and comes as one element or two ganged elements; RK09D turns 300°, is single only and always has a collar. Vertical and horizontal (6.5 mm or 10 mm shaft height) mountings, flat, knurled-knob and screwdriver shafts, an optional centre detent, values from 5 kΩ to 200 kΩ and four tapers are offered.",
